(6792244, 1020356, 99263, '<td valign="top">Ag dis pragtig Amanda. Die sneeu het my onkant gevang, maar jy is reg, ek moes geweet het...natuurlik, dit kan soms die tyd van die jaar sneeu daar in Clarens en omgewing.</td>', 'Ag dis pragtig Amanda. Die sneeu het my onkant gevang, maar jy is reg, ek moes geweet het...natuurlik, dit kan soms die tyd van die jaar sneeu daar in Clarens en omgewing.', '2012-06-11 06:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792248, 1020511, 108069, '<td valign="top">Soothingly beautiful. Lovely pastel colors and dreamy haze.</td>', 'Soothingly beautiful. Lovely pastel colors and dreamy haze.', '2012-06-11 07:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792362, 1020356, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like this a lot.  Abstract and yet emotional.</td>', 'I really like this a lot.  Abstract and yet emotional.', '2012-06-11 11:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792364, 1020528, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love this.  That crack makes it for me.</td>', 'I love this.  That crack makes it for me.', '2012-06-11 11:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792365, 1020440, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is great!!</td>', 'This is great!!', '2012-06-11 11:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792366, 1020511, 15711, '<td valign="top">The pastel palette is gorgeous.  Such an odd thing to be there.  I like the story it gives us the creativity to create.</td>', 'The pastel palette is gorgeous.  Such an odd thing to be there.  I like the story it gives us the creativity to create.', '2012-06-11 11:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792367, 1020359, 15711, '<td valign="top">oh I love this!!!!</td>', 'oh I love this!!!!', '2012-06-11 11:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792368, 1020399, 15711, '<td valign="top">This made me smile.</td>', 'This made me smile.', '2012-06-11 11:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792426, 1020233, 62249, '<td valign="top">The vignetting around the edges isn''t particularly flattering for this image. There''s potential here for an interesting shot if you make the sand pit or the heavy equipment working in the sand the subject.</td>', 'The vignetting around the edges isn''t particularly flattering for this image. There''s potential here for an interesting shot if you make the sand pit or the heavy equipment working in the sand the subject.', '2012-06-11 13:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792428, 1020394, 62249, '<td valign="top">Dreamy.</td>', 'Dreamy.', '2012-06-11 13:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792430, 1020334, 62249, '<td valign="top">Consider a square crop, removing the bottom (foreground). That might give the composition more drama.</td>', 'Consider a square crop, removing the bottom (foreground). That might give the composition more drama.', '2012-06-11 13:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792434, 1020503, 62249, '<td valign="top">The line formed by the water''s edge is interesting, but overall the shot is kinda flat. Try shooting at a different time of day when you can get more interesting shadows, highlights, and contrast.</td>', 'The line formed by the water''s edge is interesting, but overall the shot is kinda flat. Try shooting at a different time of day when you can get more interesting shadows, highlights, and contrast.', '2012-06-11 13:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792435, 1019885, 62249, '<td valign="top">Cute. The drink umbrella is a nice touch.</td>', 'Cute. The drink umbrella is a nice touch.', '2012-06-11 13:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792439, 1020356, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lighting, shadows, color, contrast are all good. Composition is average. Maybe try filling more of the frame with the scroll part of the lower fence corner? Not enough to eliminate the interesting shadow lines, but enough that you get a leading line effect from the shadows.</td>', 'Lighting, shadows, color, contrast are all good. Composition is average. Maybe try filling more of the frame with the scroll part of the lower fence corner? Not enough to eliminate the interesting shadow lines, but enough that you get a leading line effect from the shadows.', '2012-06-11 13:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792442, 1020270, 62249, '<td valign="top">Looks like Whiterook''s style, and the composition works pretty well.</td>', 'Looks like Whiterook''s style, and the composition works pretty well.', '2012-06-11 13:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792443, 1020538, 62249, '<td valign="top">Motion blur is okay, but somewhere in the sand there should be an area of sharp focus.</td>', 'Motion blur is okay, but somewhere in the sand there should be an area of sharp focus.', '2012-06-11 13:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792444, 1020544, 62249, '<td valign="top">Good use of foreground, middle ground, background. I like the composition a lot.</td>', 'Good use of foreground, middle ground, background. I like the composition a lot.', '2012-06-11 13:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792445, 1020398, 62249, '<td valign="top">This sort of shot works better if you''ve got more depth of field. Foreground is too blurred. Lighting is also rather flat. But I like the cool tones in the ocean and the way the sandy area juts into the water.</td>', 'This sort of shot works better if you''ve got more depth of field. Foreground is too blurred. Lighting is also rather flat. But I like the cool tones in the ocean and the way the sandy area juts into the water.', '2012-06-11 13:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792447, 1020277, 117534, '<td valign="top">Wow is this for real??? If not then double WOW for what ever you did to make this look JUST like the Sahara!!!  (Anita??)</td>', 'Wow is this for real??? If not then double WOW for what ever you did to make this look JUST like the Sahara!!!  (Anita??)', '2012-06-11 13:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792448, 1020371, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lighting is too flat. The way you filled the cup is good, and the patterns in the rim of the glass are also good. The tray of sand underneath, though, detracts from the cup.</td>', 'Lighting is too flat. The way you filled the cup is good, and the patterns in the rim of the glass are also good. The tray of sand underneath, though, detracts from the cup.', '2012-06-11 13:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792449, 1020511, 117534, '<td valign="top">OH MY I LOVE LOVE LOVE THIS&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; If you have some drinkies waiting for me it''s a 10+</td>', 'OH MY I LOVE LOVE LOVE THIS>>>>> If you have some drinkies waiting for me it''s a 10+', '2012-06-11 13:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792451, 1020550, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting on the shell. Overall composition isn''t as strong as it might be. The dark bit of seaweed (if that''s what it is) is too distracting.</td>', 'Nice lighting on the shell. Overall composition isn''t as strong as it might be. The dark bit of seaweed (if that''s what it is) is too distracting.', '2012-06-11 13:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792452, 1020251, 62249, '<td valign="top">Good composition and use of leading lines. Lighting is pretty harsh and contrasty.</td>', 'Good composition and use of leading lines. Lighting is pretty harsh and contrasty.', '2012-06-11 13:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792457, 1020428, 62249, '<td valign="top">Pretty shell. Needs more sharpness, less contrast.</td>', 'Pretty shell. Needs more sharpness, less contrast.', '2012-06-11 13:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792462, 1020545, 62249, '<td valign="top">Needs sharper focus on the sand. Also clone out the distracting bits in the lower corners. Bits of the hourglass are visible there, and they clutter up your composition. Lighting has some nice drama to it.</td>', 'Needs sharper focus on the sand. Also clone out the distracting bits in the lower corners. Bits of the hourglass are visible there, and they clutter up your composition. Lighting has some nice drama to it.', '2012-06-11 13:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792467, 1020500, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lovely tonal range. Not jazzed about the border, but the image itself is very good. Hope this finishes in the top 10.</td>', 'Lovely tonal range. Not jazzed about the border, but the image itself is very good. Hope this finishes in the top 10.', '2012-06-11 13:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792468, 1020291, 62249, '<td valign="top">Like the image. Good reflection of clouds in the water. Good use of leading lines. Nice contrast. Don''t like the border at all.</td>', 'Like the image. Good reflection of clouds in the water. Good use of leading lines. Nice contrast. Don''t like the border at all.', '2012-06-11 13:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792471, 1020399, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. Great moody feel and good contrast and softness. Border is overbearing.</td>', 'Lovely image. Great moody feel and good contrast and softness. Border is overbearing.', '2012-06-11 13:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792476, 1020511, 62249, '<td valign="top">Love the colors in this.</td>', 'Love the colors in this.', '2012-06-11 13:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792477, 1020359, 62249, '<td valign="top">Interesting image with good tonal range and good lighting on the birds. Dramatic clouds are good too. Border detracts from the image.</td>', 'Interesting image with good tonal range and good lighting on the birds. Dramatic clouds are good too. Border detracts from the image.', '2012-06-11 13:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792479, 1019458, 62249, '<td valign="top">The colors are interesting, but the image doesn''t tell any kind of story.</td>', 'The colors are interesting, but the image doesn''t tell any kind of story.', '2012-06-11 13:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792480, 1019657, 62249, '<td valign="top">This image is okay, as abstracts go, but doesn''t tell much of a story.</td>', 'This image is okay, as abstracts go, but doesn''t tell much of a story.', '2012-06-11 13:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792482, 1020383, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lighting is okay, but there''s no story being told here. Light specks are also visible on your surface. Clone ''em out.</td>', 'Lighting is okay, but there''s no story being told here. Light specks are also visible on your surface. Clone ''em out.', '2012-06-11 13:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792501, 1020511, 10785, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo and nice use of slow shutter to capture some motion and get that fourth element into your shot! Love the pastel colors of the sunset and the interest added by the hammock! I think all the light is on the left side (obviously) and I am constantly moving away from the hammock to stare at the beautiful orange glow. The compositional element (rule of thirds) used to make the hammock the subject didn''t fully create the main focal point. If the hammock had some more light shed on it, if it were brighter, that would have helped to emphasize that as the focal point.</td>', 'Wonderful photo and nice use of slow shutter to capture some motion and get that fourth element into your shot! Love the pastel colors of the sunset and the interest added by the hammock! I think all the light is on the left side (obviously) and I am constantly moving away from the hammock to stare at the beautiful orange glow. The compositional element (rule of thirds) used to make the hammock the subject didn''t fully create the main focal point. If the hammock had some more light shed on it, if it were brighter, that would have helped to emphasize that as the focal point.', '2012-06-11 15:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792503, 1020151, 10785, '<td valign="top">wonderful landscape! unfortunately your beautiful leading line directs me right to the trash receptacles!</td>', 'wonderful landscape! unfortunately your beautiful leading line directs me right to the trash receptacles!', '2012-06-11 15:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6792505, 1019535, 10785, '<td valign="top">Getting closer to the rocks would have put them right in the foreground. Why did you desaturate everything but the blue channel?</td>', 'Getting closer to the rocks would have put them right in the foreground. Why did you desaturate everything but the blue channel?', '2012-06-11 15:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
