(6796754, 1019657, 67258, '<td valign="top">A pile of sand yes, but to me a dull photo.  As a record shot, fine, but I want something more from the photo, a rendition of texture or a degree of the wider context.</td>', 'A pile of sand yes, but to me a dull photo.  As a record shot, fine, but I want something more from the photo, a rendition of texture or a degree of the wider context.', '2012-06-16 17:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6796755, 1020500, 67258, '<td valign="top">A lovely sunset, beautifully photographed, but that is what this photo is about; undoubtedly a  good photo, but I would have scored much higher if the foreground sand had been the subject,  6.</td>', 'A lovely sunset, beautifully photographed, but that is what this photo is about; undoubtedly a  good photo, but I would have scored much higher if the foreground sand had been the subject,  6.', '2012-06-16 17:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
