(6797267, 1020277, 138630, '<td valign="top">After much deliberation, this comes out as my only 10 - so many excellent images at the top in this challenge :)  I love the simplicity of the design and the tremendous impact of this image.</td>', 'After much deliberation, this comes out as my only 10 - so many excellent images at the top in this challenge :)  I love the simplicity of the design and the tremendous impact of this image.', '2012-06-17 23:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
