(6797277, 1020394, 23412, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the light works here.  The designs in the sand create interest, but the lighter color is really what sets a positive tone.  The water seems dark and the sky darker still, but we see a lighted foreground and a playful designer in a white dress.  It conjures thoughts of hope in the face of adversity.  Great capture!</td>', 'I really like the way the light works here.  The designs in the sand create interest, but the lighter color is really what sets a positive tone.  The water seems dark and the sky darker still, but we see a lighted foreground and a playful designer in a white dress.  It conjures thoughts of hope in the face of adversity.  Great capture!', '2012-06-18 00:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
