(6797294, 1020546, 23412, '<td valign="top">I really like the alignment of the two mountains.  Is that Fuji in the background?  I might have tried to make the sand mountain look more like its bigger sibling, but the alignment is great, the colors are great, and the scale is great.  That sand mountain looks a bit like a gnome from behind, by the way. Perfect!</td>', 'I really like the alignment of the two mountains.  Is that Fuji in the background?  I might have tried to make the sand mountain look more like its bigger sibling, but the alignment is great, the colors are great, and the scale is great.  That sand mountain looks a bit like a gnome from behind, by the way. Perfect!', '2012-06-18 00:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
