(6797412, 1020265, 67258, '<td valign="top">I''d stick with the commenters'' score!  Undervalued.<br/></td>', 'I''d stick with the commenters'' score!  Undervalued.', '2012-06-18 03:44:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6797414, 1020549, 113156, '<td valign="top">Can''t believe I didn''t vote or comment on this, don''t understand why it''s not in the top five, nice one Deb.</td>', 'Can''t believe I didn''t vote or comment on this, don''t understand why it''s not in the top five, nice one Deb.', '2012-06-18 04:27:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6797416, 1020486, 35602, '<td valign="top">I see what you mean about the score.  I guess I was the only one that actually gave you a high score (9)  Why did I?  Because it was different and artistic.  I like artistic.  Unfortunately, as I have been told in my own artistic endeavors, it doesn''t cut it with DP.  Perhaps they didn''t like the shallow dof, or maybe they felt the flame was too out of focus, or maybe they just thought it didn''t meet the challenge, but I would definitely post it in an individual photo thread and see what the masses have to say.  You should take heart in the fact that the bulk of the voters did give you an even 5.  A few more higher scores would have put you at least into the 5 category.<br/></td>', 'I see what you mean about the score.  I guess I was the only one that actually gave you a high score (9)  Why did I?  Because it was different and artistic.  I like artistic.  Unfortunately, as I have been told in my own artistic endeavors, it doesn''t cut it with DP.  Perhaps they didn''t like the shallow dof, or maybe they felt the flame was too out of focus, or maybe they just thought it didn''t meet the challenge, but I would definitely post it in an individual photo thread and see what the masses have to say.  You should take heart in the fact that the bulk of the voters did give you an even 5.  A few more higher scores would have put you at least into the 5 category.', '2012-06-18 05:22:06.000000', NULL, 0),
